(7672686, 1253260, 56579, '<td valign="top">Focus to me looks too far back, behind the snakes head.  I also think you would have been better to work within the challenge and produce an aspect ratio that might have been printed on a book.</td>', 'Focus to me looks too far back, behind the snakes head.  I also think you would have been better to work within the challenge and produce an aspect ratio that might have been printed on a book.', '2020-08-20 10:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7672687, 1252881, 56579, '<td valign="top">You could have made so much more of this photo.  The noise is on the edge of being distracting.  What is more of a visual struggle for me is the non-level horizon.  IMO water scenes more than any require a perfect flat horizon (unless the water is moving).  I think for the book cover challenge you should have worked within the aspect ratio of a book cover.  This is a photo I think could have worked well with some additional editing.</td>', 'You could have made so much more of this photo.  The noise is on the edge of being distracting.  What is more of a visual struggle for me is the non-level horizon.  IMO water scenes more than any require a perfect flat horizon (unless the water is moving).  I think for the book cover challenge you should have worked within the aspect ratio of a book cover.  This is a photo I think could have worked well with some additional editing.', '2020-08-20 11:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
