(7673312, 1253376, 135744, '<td valign="top">Fantastic! I was very disappointed not to get to photograph the Puffins this year again - I had actually booked a 2 night stay on Skomer island but that was cancelled due to Covid-19. Fortunately they have moved the booking to next year as it was really difficult to book it - literally took me days! I doubt I will get as good a photo as this though. Congrats!</td>', 'Fantastic! I was very disappointed not to get to photograph the Puffins this year again - I had actually booked a 2 night stay on Skomer island but that was cancelled due to Covid-19. Fortunately they have moved the booking to next year as it was really difficult to book it - literally took me days! I doubt I will get as good a photo as this though. Congrats!', '2020-08-27 05:51:00.000000', NULL, 0),
